Implemented multiple strategies — 𝘍𝘪𝘹𝘦𝘥 𝘞𝘪𝘯𝘥𝘰𝘸, 𝘚𝘭𝘪𝘥𝘪𝘯𝘨 𝘞𝘪𝘯𝘥𝘰𝘸, 𝘢𝘯𝘥 𝘛𝘰𝘬𝘦𝘯 𝘉𝘶𝘤𝘬𝘦𝘵 — allowing for tailored rate limiting based on endpoint usage patterns.

✅ 𝗥𝗲𝗱𝗶𝘀-𝗣𝗼𝘄𝗲𝗿𝗲𝗱 𝗗𝗶𝘀𝘁𝗿𝗶𝗯𝘂𝘁𝗲𝗱 𝗖𝗼𝗻𝘀𝗶𝘀𝘁𝗲𝗻𝗰𝘆
Leveraging 𝘙𝘦𝘥𝘪𝘴 (via Jedis) ensures consistent rate limiting across multiple instances in a microservices architecture, ideal for horizontal scaling.

